### Deliberately excluded from the payload

`chromadb` and its transitive dependencies (`onnxruntime`, `tokenizers`,
`grpcio`, `kubernetes`, `numpy`), plus `pytest`, `playwright`, `torch`,
`transformers`, `sentence-transformers` and `Pillow`. The app degrades to
SQLite FTS5 keyword retrieval without `chromadb`. See
`requirements-optional.txt` and `docs/distribution/windows-packaging-decision.md`.

### Not redistributed

The `Zain` and `Cairo` font binaries that exist in the private development
repository are **not** part of this distribution; their redistribution rights
are unverified. See `docs/opensource/license-audit.md`.

================================================================================
NO MODEL WEIGHTS ARE REDISTRIBUTED
================================================================================

This repository and the Windows installers contain **no** model weights, LoRA
adapters, embedding models or vision models. The installer is roughly 23 MB
compressed (about 41 MB installed) of application code, the CPython runtime and
the Python libraries listed above. Nothing else.

The first public beta ships cloud AI only (OpenRouter or OpenAI), using the
user's own API key. No on-device model download exists in this release.

================================================================================
NO OWNED CREDENTIALS
================================================================================

No API key, token or account credential for any third-party service is included
in this distribution. Users supply their own provider credentials, which are
stored locally in a Windows DPAPI-encrypted vault on their own machine.
